{"ref":"BDB, פָּסַל","hw":"פָּסַל","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">פָּסַל</span></big></big>  <strong>vb. hew, hew into shape (</strong>NH Pi. <em>hew off</em> boughs; Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּסַל</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܦܣܰܠ</span> = BH; Nab. <span dir=\"rtl\">פסלא</span> <em>stone-cutter</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Pf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּסָלוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:18\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.18\">Hb 2:18</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּפְסֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:4\" href=\"/Exodus.34.4\">Ex 34:4</a>, etc.; Imv. ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּסָל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:1\" href=\"/Exodus.34.1\">Ex 34:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.1\">Dt 10:1</a>;—<em>hew out</em> stone tablets <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:1\" href=\"/Exodus.34.1\">Ex 34:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:4\" href=\"/Exodus.34.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.1\">Dt 10:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.3\">3</a>; building-stones <a data-ref=\"I Kings 5:32\" href=\"/I_Kings.5.32\">1 K 5:32</a>; c. cogn. acc. (sf. referring to <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּסֶל</span>) <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:18\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.18\">Hb 2:18</a>.","next":"BDB, פֶּ֫סֶל","prev":"BDB, פָּסָךְ"}